{"ID":"20240118151010-feqmtvz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151010-feqmtvz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151010-feqmtvz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151010-bswjd0t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153455-fiq1eu3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153455-fiq1eu3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"292牙子","type":"doc","updated":"20240204103853"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151010-bswjd0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151010-bswjd0t","updated":"20240122153432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名狼牙。味苦，寒，有毒。治邪气，热气，疥瘙，恶疡，疮，痔，去白虫。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153436-gm7tvse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153436-gm7tvse"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】山中处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153437-l9nyyf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153437-l9nyyf9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153439-agzg703","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153439-agzg703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为解毒杀虫要药，治风搔，恶疮，驱寸白条虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153440-a74335v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153440-a74335v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治浮风搔痒，煎汁洗恶疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153441-0j2e2pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153441-0j2e2pj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】杀腹臓一切虫，止赤白痢，煎服。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153443-v2h38qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153443-v2h38qm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】内服须慎重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153433-nuk79oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153433-nuk79oy"}},{"ID":"20240122153443-uxvxq4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153443-uxvxq4k"}},{"ID":"20240122153443-r713osu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153443-r713osu","updated":"20240204103853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"292味，这叫牙子，牙子是古名的牙子，现在称之为狼牙。这狼牙呢，经方里面使用，在妇人阴中有疮，阴疮，不能收口，因为阴部里面有津液，是润滑的地方，所以说，有伤口在里面的时候，非常不容易收口，因为他不是干的嘛，是湿的，这个时候，我们用狼牙来治疗，哦，外敷的，你看哦，为解毒杀虫的要药，看到没有，主治：能驱寸白条虫、蛔虫。一般来说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"狼牙，煮过汤以后，用那个棉棒，放到狼牙汤里面泡，泡了这后塞到阴道里面去，能够治得那个疮，一般来说，这个狼牙呢都是外用，很少有内服的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153455-fiq1eu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153455-fiq1eu3"}}]}